OL,3,GNEWSAWasps' fight for stadium as youth 
OL,4,Aplans proposed                         
OL,6,FWasps Rugby says it is fighting a      
OL,7,Fplanning decision which dented hopes   
OL,8,Ffor a new stadium in Kent, as it puts  
OL,9,Fforward proposals for nearby youth     
OL,10,Ffacilities.                            
OL,12,FA stadium in Swanley with over 20,000  
OL,13,Fseats was put forward by the club but  
OL,14,Fwas previously threatened when land    
OL,15,Fearmarked for the project was dropped  
OL,16,Ffrom Sevenoaks District Council's local
OL,17,Fplan consultation earlier this year.   
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
