OL,3,GNEWSAWasps' fight for stadium as youth 
OL,4,Aplans proposed                         
OL,6,FA club spokesperson said it was seeking
OL,7,Fthe "reinstatement" of the stadium land
OL,8,Fin the council's plans in planning     
OL,9,Fdocuments for new community facilities 
OL,10,Fpublished this week.                   
OL,12,FThe new plans, which the club's        
OL,13,Fchairman called "a significant and     
OL,14,Fmeaningful step forward", include      
OL,15,Fjunior pitches and a new pavilion.     
